[
 {
  "en": "Do something, my brother is innocent!",
  "start": 73.79,
  "end": 75.34
 },
 {
  "en": "He's American...",
  "start": 75.49,
  "end": 77.59
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't do anything.",
  "start": 75.49,
  "end": 77.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes! Back at the crime scene, that'll prove...",
  "start": 77.77,
  "end": 81.36
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm a night clerk.",
  "start": 79.55,
  "end": 81.36
 },
 {
  "en": "You want someone who can do something, wait for the consul.",
  "start": 81.55,
  "end": 84.32
 },
 {
  "en": "He gets in in the morning.",
  "start": 84.49,
  "end": 85.89
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry.",
  "start": 86.87,
  "end": 88.02
 },
 {
  "en": "That ain't gonna cut it.",
  "start": 88.81,
  "end": 90.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Your brother, where do they have him incarcerated?",
  "start": 91.71,
  "end": 95.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Sona.",
  "start": 93.51,
  "end": 95.83
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 97.93,
  "end": 98.93
 },
 {
  "en": "The worst of the worst are there, men no other prison will take.",
  "start": 101.53,
  "end": 105.55
 },
 {
  "en": "They rioted so badly a year ago, the guards pulled out, just left them to themselves.",
  "start": 111.85,
  "end": 117.76
 },
 {
  "en": "A thousand thieves, rapists, murderers.",
  "start": 118.26,
  "end": 121.82
 },
 {
  "en": "The government just stays back, keeps the perimeter.",
  "start": 132.54,
  "end": 135.16
 },
 {
  "en": "To them, Sona's a one-way street.",
  "start": 145.34,
  "end": 148.42
 },
 {
  "en": "What goes in...",
  "start": 149.06,
  "end": 150.37
 },
 {
  "en": "Never comes out...",
  "start": 151.31,
  "end": 152.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Unless it's dead.",
  "start": 153.53,
  "end": 154.87
 },
 {
  "en": "Somebody wasn't diligent enough with this guy, and we need him moved to a facility that's a little more... moderate.",
  "start": 204.39,
  "end": 209.92
 },
 {
  "en": "All right? Thank you.",
  "start": 210.11,
  "end": 212.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Alright, the good news is as of yesterday you're a free man.",
  "start": 212.69,
  "end": 216.04
 },
 {
  "en": "You got nothing to worry about.",
  "start": 216.26,
  "end": 218.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Just my brother.",
  "start": 216.26,
  "end": 218.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Right. Well, that's a heck of a story, you two.",
  "start": 219.14,
  "end": 221.55
 },
 {
  "en": "That made the news even down here. And I understand you also have a son?",
  "start": 221.78,
  "end": 225.52
 },
 {
  "en": "LJ... Lincoln Jr.?",
  "start": 225.69,
  "end": 227.12
 },
 {
  "en": "He must be ecstatic about your exoneration.",
  "start": 227.28,
  "end": 229.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Still trying to reach him.",
  "start": 229.63,
  "end": 232.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell us where he is. We'll send...",
  "start": 229.63,
  "end": 232.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Let me handle that. Let's just focus on Michael.",
  "start": 233.03,
  "end": 235.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, well, good news is is that much of what you're saying is checking out at the crime scene.",
  "start": 236.35,
  "end": 241.31
 },
 {
  "en": "The victim did have a service revolver with U. S. government numbers on it.",
  "start": 241.46,
  "end": 245.36
 },
 {
  "en": "And if a weapon was found, then that lends real credence to self-defense as a motive.",
  "start": 245.66,
  "end": 250.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Great. Did they find anything else?",
  "start": 250.37,
  "end": 253.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Like what?",
  "start": 254.04,
  "end": 255.44
 },
 {
  "en": "A bag.",
  "start": 254.04,
  "end": 255.44
 },
 {
  "en": "What was in it?",
  "start": 255.73,
  "end": 258.19
 },
 {
  "en": "A little money.",
  "start": 255.73,
  "end": 258.19
 },
 {
  "en": "No, sorry.",
  "start": 258.84,
  "end": 259.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Of course they didn't.",
  "start": 259.99,
  "end": 262.34
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, well, whatever the case, regarding Michael, I've managed to make a little headway.",
  "start": 259.99,
  "end": 265.29
 },
 {
  "en": "I arranged the transfer of your brother to another facility tomorrow.",
  "start": 265.52,
  "end": 269.4
 },
 {
  "en": "It's a lot safer, it's a lot cleaner.",
  "start": 269.66,
  "end": 272.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Great.",
  "start": 269.66,
  "end": 272.31
 },
 {
  "en": "And if this is stacking up like I think it is, I'd be pretty confident the charges will be dropped.",
  "start": 272.63,
  "end": 278.52
 },
 {
  "en": "He'd be free?",
  "start": 279.48,
  "end": 280.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, he'd still face charges in the U. S.",
  "start": 280.63,
  "end": 282.68
 },
 {
  "en": "But out of there?",
  "start": 283.14,
  "end": 285.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes.",
  "start": 283.14,
  "end": 285.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Is there... is there a mess hall here?",
  "start": 336.07,
  "end": 338.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Mess hall?",
  "start": 338.55,
  "end": 339.55
 },
 {
  "en": "And some water. I'm dying of thirst. Please.",
  "start": 340.22,
  "end": 343.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Please.",
  "start": 343.65,
  "end": 344.65
 },
 {
  "en": "There's some water.",
  "start": 346.66,
  "end": 347.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Bite me.",
  "start": 352.48,
  "end": 353.48
 },
 {
  "en": "What'd you say?",
  "start": 355.64,
  "end": 357.93
 },
 {
  "en": "I didn't say nothing.",
  "start": 355.64,
  "end": 357.93
 },
 {
  "en": "Drink it.",
  "start": 360.94,
  "end": 361.96
 },
 {
  "en": "You hear me? Drink!",
  "start": 362.99,
  "end": 364.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, get used to it, man.",
  "start": 385.79,
  "end": 387.17
 },
 {
  "en": "I haven't eaten for days.",
  "start": 387.61,
  "end": 389.15
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on.",
  "start": 390.78,
  "end": 391.78
 },
 {
  "en": "How are you doing?",
  "start": 453.61,
  "end": 455.9
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you want, Alex?",
  "start": 453.61,
  "end": 455.9
 },
 {
  "en": "You're so clever... Planting the drugs on the boat.",
  "start": 456.84,
  "end": 459.33
 },
 {
  "en": "That's a big irony.",
  "start": 459.5,
  "end": 460.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Lawman in jail.",
  "start": 461.1,
  "end": 462.55
 },
 {
  "en": "You are exactly where you belong.",
  "start": 462.73,
  "end": 464.53
 },
 {
  "en": "No, you're wrong. And you're gonna help me.",
  "start": 464.71,
  "end": 466.92
 },
 {
  "en": "I will have a court date one day, and you will be there on the stand.",
  "start": 467.06,
  "end": 470.31
 },
 {
  "en": "And you'll tell the truth, that you planted this and you set this up, and I'm gonna go home.",
  "start": 470.53,
  "end": 475.49
 },
 {
  "en": "That's funny. I could have sworn you set this up.",
  "start": 475.77,
  "end": 478.9
 },
 {
  "en": "I set this up? I'm in here.",
  "start": 481.23,
  "end": 483.39
 },
 {
  "en": "What does the Company want with me? Why Panama?",
  "start": 483.58,
  "end": 486.05
 },
 {
  "en": "What, you think I know what they wanted?",
  "start": 486.19,
  "end": 488.35
 },
 {
  "en": "They had me.",
  "start": 489.85,
  "end": 491.04
 },
 {
  "en": "I did what they asked me to do: arrest you in Panama and hand you over.",
  "start": 491.36,
  "end": 496.16
 },
 {
  "en": "That's it. That's...",
  "start": 496.31,
  "end": 497.56
 },
 {
  "en": "That's old news, huh?",
  "start": 502.16,
  "end": 503.45
 },
 {
  "en": "This is the first day of the rest of our lives.",
  "start": 504.13,
  "end": 506.36
 },
 {
  "en": "How about we work together, help each other out.",
  "start": 506.52,
  "end": 508.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Except every time I look at you, all I can see is the man who killed my father.",
  "start": 509.06,
  "end": 513.96
 },
 {
  "en": "You're on your own.",
  "start": 516.58,
  "end": 517.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Sign here to say that once inside, you're on your own by the law, you're not protected by the military in case of an assault.",
  "start": 550.16,
  "end": 556.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Any attempt to assist an inmate trying to escape will be met with a lethal response.",
  "start": 556.45,
  "end": 560.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Wouldn't dream of it.",
  "start": 561.2,
  "end": 562.63
 },
 {
  "en": "So...",
  "start": 578.73,
  "end": 579.73
 },
 {
  "en": "So...",
  "start": 580.08,
  "end": 581.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Feel like I'm on the wrong side.",
  "start": 582.93,
  "end": 584.75
 },
 {
  "en": "You're on the right side.",
  "start": 585.49,
  "end": 587.59
 },
 {
  "en": "You're not.",
  "start": 585.49,
  "end": 587.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Gonna break me out?",
  "start": 588.57,
  "end": 591.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Too tiring. All that running.",
  "start": 588.57,
  "end": 591.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, well, maybe you should have lost the cowboy boots.",
  "start": 592.1,
  "end": 594.89
 },
 {
  "en": "You scared?",
  "start": 596.25,
  "end": 597.25
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm getting you out of here, man.",
  "start": 601.21,
  "end": 603.04
 },
 {
  "en": "The Consulate's arranged to transfer you to a safer facility until the trial...",
  "start": 603.32,
  "end": 606.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Which is about a month.",
  "start": 607.02,
  "end": 608.47
 },
 {
  "en": "They say you got a good chance.",
  "start": 608.66,
  "end": 611.66
 },
 {
  "en": "When's the transfer?",
  "start": 608.66,
  "end": 611.66
 },
 {
  "en": "Tomorrow.",
  "start": 611.92,
  "end": 612.92
 },
 {
  "en": "Just... just hold on, man, one more day.",
  "start": 613.48,
  "end": 615.71
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, I keep waiting for you to mention a certain someone.",
  "start": 616.78,
  "end": 619.88
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know where she is, man.",
  "start": 622.9,
  "end": 625.76
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, you got to find her.",
  "start": 622.9,
  "end": 625.76
 },
 {
  "en": "I will.",
  "start": 625.96,
  "end": 626.98
 },
 {
  "en": "She's important to me, Linc.",
  "start": 628.46,
  "end": 630.04
 },
 {
  "en": "If anything happens to Sara...",
  "start": 632.21,
  "end": 633.86
 },
 {
  "en": "It's going to be fine, man. I promise.",
  "start": 637.78,
  "end": 640.29
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll see you tomorrow.",
  "start": 644.34,
  "end": 645.72
 },
 {
  "en": "All right?",
  "start": 646.85,
  "end": 647.99
 },
 {
  "en": "American, right?",
  "start": 670.68,
  "end": 671.95
 },
 {
  "en": "I love America.",
  "start": 672.14,
  "end": 673.31
 },
 {
  "en": "NBA. Tracy McGrady shooting the ball in the hoop from downtown.",
  "start": 673.49,
  "end": 677.02
 },
 {
  "en": "Whatever you're selling, I'm not buying.",
  "start": 677.2,
  "end": 679.24
 },
 {
  "en": "Selling?",
  "start": 679.45,
  "end": 680.45
 },
 {
  "en": "I just want to talk basketball. Who's your team?",
  "start": 680.8,
  "end": 683.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Let's go, blanco. Orientation.",
  "start": 687.36,
  "end": 689.58
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not interested.",
  "start": 689.72,
  "end": 692.48
 },
 {
  "en": "It's not for you to decide.",
  "start": 689.72,
  "end": 692.48
 },
 {
  "en": "Bring them in.",
  "start": 711.39,
  "end": 712.46
 },
 {
  "en": "I hope they haven't been treating you too poorly.",
  "start": 730.2,
  "end": 732.72
 },
 {
  "en": "I should hear of it if you have.",
  "start": 732.91,
  "end": 734.61
 },
 {
  "en": "I think as you can tell, Sona is unlike any other place in the world.",
  "start": 734.89,
  "end": 738.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Since the riots of last year, they left us here to rot.",
  "start": 738.81,
  "end": 741.41
 },
 {
  "en": "They figured we would just destroy ourselves, but instead, we've thrived.",
  "start": 741.59,
  "end": 745.26
 },
 {
  "en": "With the canal, Panama is now a breeding ground for international crime.",
  "start": 745.68,
  "end": 749.26
 },
 {
  "en": "27 different nationalities we have here.",
  "start": 749.59,
  "end": 752.07
 },
 {
  "en": "But not one gang.",
  "start": 752.7,
  "end": 754.49
 },
 {
  "en": "Not one racially-motivated incident.",
  "start": 755.72,
  "end": 758.0
 },
 {
  "en": "It's just...",
  "start": 759.0,
  "end": 760.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Me.",
  "start": 760.64,
  "end": 761.66
 },
 {
  "en": "Egalitarianism I believe is the word.",
  "start": 764.0,
  "end": 766.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Did I get that right?",
  "start": 768.08,
  "end": 770.95
 },
 {
  "en": "Right as rain.",
  "start": 768.08,
  "end": 770.95
 },
 {
  "en": "That's what practice does for you.",
  "start": 772.5,
  "end": 774.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, is there anything you want to tell me?",
  "start": 775.01,
  "end": 779.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Any history that you bring to this place that I should know about?",
  "start": 780.02,
  "end": 783.02
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't think you're quite telling me the truth.",
  "start": 792.25,
  "end": 794.43
 },
 {
  "en": "We get the news, man.",
  "start": 797.73,
  "end": 799.34
 },
 {
  "en": "You were quite the superstar on CNN.",
  "start": 799.98,
  "end": 802.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Man breaks brother out... and flees to Panama.",
  "start": 802.57,
  "end": 805.62
 },
 {
  "en": "But you're not a superstar here!",
  "start": 808.43,
  "end": 810.26
 },
 {
  "en": "You realize that, don't you?",
  "start": 810.7,
  "end": 813.6
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not going to make waves.",
  "start": 810.7,
  "end": 813.6
 },
 {
  "en": "It wouldn't be within your power.",
  "start": 814.69,
  "end": 816.45
 },
 {
  "en": "I heard about the two of you.",
  "start": 824.02,
  "end": 825.61
 },
 {
  "en": "You two in the hall today.",
  "start": 825.94,
  "end": 827.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, if you'd like to sort your problems out, it's very simple here.",
  "start": 828.26,
  "end": 831.58
 },
 {
  "en": "A man has a beef with another, he makes his problem known.",
  "start": 834.57,
  "end": 837.57
 },
 {
  "en": "And then we deal with it directly as men... over there.",
  "start": 839.27,
  "end": 843.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Won't be necessary.",
  "start": 845.57,
  "end": 847.13
 },
 {
  "en": "You always shake like that?",
  "start": 858.56,
  "end": 860.42
 },
 {
  "en": "Or just when you're scared of someone?",
  "start": 862.2,
  "end": 864.19
 },
 {
  "en": "I think he gets the message.",
  "start": 893.19,
  "end": 895.05
 },
 {
  "en": "We could go... You and me... right here.",
  "start": 898.79,
  "end": 901.07
 },
 {
  "en": "You're a brave man, huh?",
  "start": 905.59,
  "end": 907.27
 },
 {
  "en": "You're lucky I've been meditating.",
  "start": 913.67,
  "end": 915.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Before, I couldn't take my finger off the trigger, but now, now, I have mind control.",
  "start": 915.64,
  "end": 920.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Complete control.",
  "start": 921.52,
  "end": 923.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Mind...",
  "start": 923.99,
  "end": 925.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Body...",
  "start": 925.53,
  "end": 926.56
 },
 {
  "en": "And soul.",
  "start": 927.29,
  "end": 928.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Get out!",
  "start": 931.55,
  "end": 932.56
 },
 {
  "en": "He's a waste of our time.",
  "start": 943.87,
  "end": 945.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Who would have thought... a famous person in Sona.",
  "start": 945.75,
  "end": 949.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Weak people rally around fame.",
  "start": 949.6,
  "end": 951.58
 },
 {
  "en": "They worship it. They're blinded by it.",
  "start": 951.84,
  "end": 953.79
 },
 {
  "en": "There are many people of weak character behind these walls.",
  "start": 954.02,
  "end": 956.63
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes, they will follow a man like this, and they will put him on a pedestal.",
  "start": 956.77,
  "end": 961.12
 },
 {
  "en": "He has that charisma, right, mami?",
  "start": 964.5,
  "end": 967.33
 },
 {
  "en": "He's no you.",
  "start": 967.94,
  "end": 969.12
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't have to pander me, mami.",
  "start": 969.99,
  "end": 971.79
 },
 {
  "en": "He's good looking, right?",
  "start": 973.8,
  "end": 975.37
 },
 {
  "en": "He's the best looking man in the prison, right?",
  "start": 980.49,
  "end": 982.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Not compared to you.",
  "start": 982.88,
  "end": 984.26
 },
 {
  "en": "I told you, mami...",
  "start": 985.46,
  "end": 986.76
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara Tancredi... she's an American. She's missing.",
  "start": 1055.5,
  "end": 1057.92
 },
 {
  "en": "We don't have a report of anything like that.",
  "start": 1058.06,
  "end": 1060.31
 },
 {
  "en": "But if you do, you call me. The number's on the back.",
  "start": 1060.66,
  "end": 1063.35
 },
 {
  "en": "Anything, you call me, alright?",
  "start": 1065.79,
  "end": 1068.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Will do.",
  "start": 1065.79,
  "end": 1068.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "start": 1069.61,
  "end": 1070.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Where'd you get shoes?",
  "start": 1079.82,
  "end": 1081.32
 },
 {
  "en": "It's time to start earning your rent, here.",
  "start": 1090.3,
  "end": 1092.33
 },
 {
  "en": "There's no rent, it's prison.",
  "start": 1092.5,
  "end": 1094.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Keep talking.",
  "start": 1092.5,
  "end": 1094.6
 },
 {
  "en": "It's going up. Here.",
  "start": 1094.74,
  "end": 1096.24
 },
 {
  "en": "Work time's started right now.",
  "start": 1097.82,
  "end": 1099.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Where?",
  "start": 1101.76,
  "end": 1102.76
 },
 {
  "en": "Hell no.",
  "start": 1105.62,
  "end": 1107.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Absolutely not.",
  "start": 1105.62,
  "end": 1107.6
 },
 {
  "en": "One more word from you, and I will drown you in here, you understand?",
  "start": 1109.63,
  "end": 1113.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, work.",
  "start": 1115.74,
  "end": 1116.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Burn it down in the sewers when you're done.",
  "start": 1118.32,
  "end": 1120.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Elliot Pike.",
  "start": 1201.2,
  "end": 1203.15
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you want?",
  "start": 1201.2,
  "end": 1203.15
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, to be frank, to represent you.",
  "start": 1203.55,
  "end": 1205.49
 },
 {
  "en": "You're a lawyer?",
  "start": 1205.63,
  "end": 1207.45
 },
 {
  "en": "Of sorts.",
  "start": 1205.63,
  "end": 1207.45
 },
 {
  "en": "The court already appointed me a lawyer.",
  "start": 1207.7,
  "end": 1209.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Then perhaps I can be of assistance in a different way.",
  "start": 1211.71,
  "end": 1215.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Somehow I doubt that.",
  "start": 1216.12,
  "end": 1217.55
 },
 {
  "en": "I got a lot of big guns behind me, Mr. Scofield, people you might like to have in your corner should you ever decide, say... to break out of here.",
  "start": 1217.77,
  "end": 1225.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Who are you?",
  "start": 1230.56,
  "end": 1231.71
 },
 {
  "en": "We can assist you in every possible way once you get past that wall.",
  "start": 1231.91,
  "end": 1236.06
 },
 {
  "en": "There's a reason a guy like you, with your skill set, was put in here, you know.",
  "start": 1241.23,
  "end": 1245.41
 },
 {
  "en": "This conversation's over.",
  "start": 1248.18,
  "end": 1249.41
 },
 {
  "en": "You should listen to what I have to say. We're trying to do this the easy way!",
  "start": 1249.55,
  "end": 1253.35
 },
 {
  "en": "What the hell are you doing taking my stash?",
  "start": 1286.35,
  "end": 1288.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Cough it up, you bitch!",
  "start": 1288.44,
  "end": 1289.81
 },
 {
  "en": "I didn't do it.",
  "start": 1289.97,
  "end": 1291.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is it?",
  "start": 1289.97,
  "end": 1291.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is it?",
  "start": 1291.75,
  "end": 1293.4
 },
 {
  "en": "It wasn't me.",
  "start": 1291.75,
  "end": 1293.4
 },
 {
  "en": "You know the rules about extra-curricular fights!",
  "start": 1299.5,
  "end": 1301.95
 },
 {
  "en": "It doesn't happen here.",
  "start": 1303.26,
  "end": 1304.67
 },
 {
  "en": "He took something that belongs to me.",
  "start": 1305.07,
  "end": 1307.99
 },
 {
  "en": "He's out of his mind.",
  "start": 1305.07,
  "end": 1307.99
 },
 {
  "en": "It seems pretty easy to get to the bottom of this... check him.",
  "start": 1308.18,
  "end": 1311.07
 },
 {
  "en": "Check his area.",
  "start": 1318.74,
  "end": 1319.86
 },
 {
  "en": "That's bull.",
  "start": 1332.02,
  "end": 1333.11
 },
 {
  "en": "You're both scumbags.",
  "start": 1335.09,
  "end": 1337.5
 },
 {
  "en": "You and me, man, we're not done here.",
  "start": 1343.33,
  "end": 1345.91
 },
 {
  "en": "You haven't seen her? No one like this has checked in?",
  "start": 1351.84,
  "end": 1354.54
 },
 {
  "en": "You're absolutely sure?",
  "start": 1355.32,
  "end": 1356.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Thanks.",
  "start": 1359.54,
  "end": 1360.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 1362.58,
  "end": 1363.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Mr. Burrows. Captain Itzuris at the constable's office.",
  "start": 1363.89,
  "end": 1367.0
 },
 {
  "en": "We found an American woman matching the description of your friend, Ms. Tancredi.",
  "start": 1367.39,
  "end": 1372.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Where?",
  "start": 1373.77,
  "end": 1374.77
 },
 {
  "en": "At the morgue.",
  "start": 1375.71,
  "end": 1376.71
 },
 {
  "en": "What's he saying?",
  "start": 1390.26,
  "end": 1391.45
 },
 {
  "en": "That we can't eat.",
  "start": 1391.6,
  "end": 1392.79
 },
 {
  "en": "What are we supposed to eat?",
  "start": 1392.94,
  "end": 1394.46
 },
 {
  "en": "They expect us to forage, like dogs.",
  "start": 1410.04,
  "end": 1412.23
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll die. I will literally die.",
  "start": 1412.88,
  "end": 1414.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Hang in there, man.",
  "start": 1421.19,
  "end": 1422.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Playing by yourself. Same old Pretty.",
  "start": 1455.44,
  "end": 1457.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Just not good at making friends, are you?",
  "start": 1458.29,
  "end": 1460.45
 },
 {
  "en": "We got nothing to say to each other.",
  "start": 1460.75,
  "end": 1462.62
 },
 {
  "en": "On another note, them big government types that shook me so hard, why did they wanted you here?",
  "start": 1462.81,
  "end": 1468.09
 },
 {
  "en": "Was it Sona they was interested in? I'm wondering.",
  "start": 1468.28,
  "end": 1470.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Want me to get you down here, in this very county.",
  "start": 1470.97,
  "end": 1473.46
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you think it is? You think it's Sona?",
  "start": 1473.65,
  "end": 1476.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Who'd be interested in a dump like this?",
  "start": 1476.4,
  "end": 1478.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Runner! Runner!",
  "start": 1478.9,
  "end": 1480.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Thanks for getting back to me.",
  "start": 1555.58,
  "end": 1557.92
 },
 {
  "en": "No problem.",
  "start": 1555.58,
  "end": 1557.92
 },
 {
  "en": "The body was fished out of the pond this morning.",
  "start": 1558.13,
  "end": 1560.96
 },
 {
  "en": "Where?",
  "start": 1561.27,
  "end": 1562.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Calle Sesenta-Seis.",
  "start": 1562.42,
  "end": 1564.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Just west of Avenida Colon.",
  "start": 1564.44,
  "end": 1566.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Sir?",
  "start": 1570.56,
  "end": 1571.56
 },
 {
  "en": "That's the last place I saw her.",
  "start": 1572.2,
  "end": 1573.99
 },
 {
  "en": "It's not her.",
  "start": 1590.4,
  "end": 1591.49
 },
 {
  "en": "It's not her.",
  "start": 1593.85,
  "end": 1594.92
 },
 {
  "en": "Someone's thrown the glove down on you.",
  "start": 1609.73,
  "end": 1611.68
 },
 {
  "en": "The gauntlet, right?",
  "start": 1611.89,
  "end": 1613.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, except we both know I didn't take those drugs.",
  "start": 1613.32,
  "end": 1615.83
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not the judge.",
  "start": 1615.97,
  "end": 1617.15
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't deal in the claims people make.",
  "start": 1617.29,
  "end": 1619.19
 },
 {
  "en": "I just make sure the rules are followed. And the rules say all grievances are dealt with two men in a ring, a fight.",
  "start": 1619.38,
  "end": 1625.4
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll be leaving tomorrow, so that won't be necessary.",
  "start": 1626.02,
  "end": 1628.57
 },
 {
  "en": "It may not be necessary to you, but it is to me.",
  "start": 1628.82,
  "end": 1631.21
 },
 {
  "en": "I have a duty to maintain order here...",
  "start": 1631.82,
  "end": 1633.95
 },
 {
  "en": "An ironclad legal system that assures that no one goes independent with their grievances, as is so often the case in other prisons.",
  "start": 1634.67,
  "end": 1641.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Here, there is a system, and that system means order.",
  "start": 1641.73,
  "end": 1645.39
 },
 {
  "en": "So whether you agree with it or not does not matter to me.",
  "start": 1645.74,
  "end": 1648.64
 },
 {
  "en": "There's a larger agenda than yours.",
  "start": 1649.45,
  "end": 1651.38
 },
 {
  "en": "What happens if I refuse?",
  "start": 1655.66,
  "end": 1657.42
 },
 {
  "en": "We'll come for you.",
  "start": 1658.75,
  "end": 1659.99
 },
 {
  "en": "And I can guarantee you that is an outcome that you will not like.",
  "start": 1661.86,
  "end": 1666.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell me something... do you always set up your fights?",
  "start": 1666.79,
  "end": 1669.85
 },
 {
  "en": "I had nothing to do with it.",
  "start": 1671.23,
  "end": 1672.88
 },
 {
  "en": "And yet the only one in this prison who has a problem with me is you.",
  "start": 1673.5,
  "end": 1677.46
 },
 {
  "en": "I'd be glad to see you go down...",
  "start": 1678.55,
  "end": 1680.19
 },
 {
  "en": "Superstar.",
  "start": 1680.7,
  "end": 1681.7
 },
 {
  "en": "Go on, keep going.",
  "start": 1694.17,
  "end": 1695.49
 },
 {
  "en": "You burn it around the corner.",
  "start": 1695.82,
  "end": 1697.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Think you can do me a favor?",
  "start": 1736.54,
  "end": 1738.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Bite me.",
  "start": 1739.15,
  "end": 1740.22
 },
 {
  "en": "I can feed you.",
  "start": 1740.46,
  "end": 1741.55
 },
 {
  "en": "A few weeks ago, I was in your shoes.",
  "start": 1744.56,
  "end": 1746.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Didn't get any food for days.",
  "start": 1746.63,
  "end": 1748.34
 },
 {
  "en": "They'd have let me die, just like they're gonna let you die.",
  "start": 1748.57,
  "end": 1751.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Get back to the \"feed me\" part.",
  "start": 1751.44,
  "end": 1753.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Chicken. Man, where'd you get chicken?",
  "start": 1758.84,
  "end": 1761.39
 },
 {
  "en": "That's not chicken.",
  "start": 1762.93,
  "end": 1764.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Want some more?",
  "start": 1769.93,
  "end": 1770.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Then you're gonna have to run an errand for me.",
  "start": 1773.07,
  "end": 1775.46
 },
 {
  "en": "What kind of errand?",
  "start": 1775.87,
  "end": 1776.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad? It's me.",
  "start": 1786.78,
  "end": 1788.94
 },
 {
  "en": "LJ.",
  "start": 1786.78,
  "end": 1788.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Where are you?",
  "start": 1789.51,
  "end": 1791.39
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm in Panama.",
  "start": 1789.51,
  "end": 1791.39
 },
 {
  "en": "What? How...",
  "start": 1792.74,
  "end": 1794.43
 },
 {
  "en": "How'd you get this number?",
  "start": 1795.96,
  "end": 1798.29
 },
 {
  "en": "I ran into Sara.",
  "start": 1795.96,
  "end": 1798.29
 },
 {
  "en": "The consulate gave her your number.",
  "start": 1798.44,
  "end": 1800.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad, I'm cutting out.",
  "start": 1800.32,
  "end": 1801.91
 },
 {
  "en": "LJ?",
  "start": 1800.32,
  "end": 1801.91
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't hear you.",
  "start": 1802.38,
  "end": 1804.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad, do this.",
  "start": 1802.38,
  "end": 1804.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Meet us at the restaurant in the Garfield Price building, at the top.",
  "start": 1804.79,
  "end": 1809.64
 },
 {
  "en": "Garfield what?",
  "start": 1807.94,
  "end": 1809.64
 },
 {
  "en": "Time to fight, blanco.",
  "start": 1825.57,
  "end": 1826.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Best to make your peace with God.",
  "start": 1833.47,
  "end": 1835.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Uno, dos, tres, all right?",
  "start": 1840.24,
  "end": 1841.9
 },
 {
  "en": "What? Even at 10-1?",
  "start": 1844.95,
  "end": 1846.38
 },
 {
  "en": "There's a reason he chose World.",
  "start": 1846.58,
  "end": 1848.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Six consecutive life terms, okay?",
  "start": 1848.45,
  "end": 1850.7
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm just kidding, man.",
  "start": 1863.57,
  "end": 1865.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Tranquilo!",
  "start": 1865.46,
  "end": 1866.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Surely, it's beneath a man of your status to be walking around like that all sticky-like.",
  "start": 1873.97,
  "end": 1879.02
 },
 {
  "en": "Leave him.",
  "start": 1879.28,
  "end": 1880.31
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you propose?",
  "start": 1881.26,
  "end": 1882.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Ablution.",
  "start": 1884.04,
  "end": 1885.06
 },
 {
  "en": "A humble sign of friendship from a stranger who's come into your house.",
  "start": 1887.48,
  "end": 1891.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Sorry about that.",
  "start": 1900.52,
  "end": 1901.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Just... half a man down here.",
  "start": 1902.3,
  "end": 1905.07
 },
 {
  "en": "What's your name, norteño?",
  "start": 1908.59,
  "end": 1910.06
 },
 {
  "en": "You can just call me...",
  "start": 1911.23,
  "end": 1912.73
 },
 {
  "en": "\"friend.\"",
  "start": 1913.44,
  "end": 1914.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Go for the kneecap.",
  "start": 1924.36,
  "end": 1925.72
 },
 {
  "en": "You...",
  "start": 1927.55,
  "end": 1928.57
 },
 {
  "en": "You hit it straight on, it'll buckle, and you'll take the guy out of commission.",
  "start": 1929.82,
  "end": 1934.19
 },
 {
  "en": "Fighting dirty? That's your secret?",
  "start": 1934.88,
  "end": 1936.93
 },
 {
  "en": "I didn't think there was any such thing as clean in a place like this.",
  "start": 1937.58,
  "end": 1941.47
 },
 {
  "en": "You know, I'm surprised, Alex.",
  "start": 1942.39,
  "end": 1944.04
 },
 {
  "en": "It almost sounds like you care.",
  "start": 1944.69,
  "end": 1946.44
 },
 {
  "en": "You're my get-out-of-jail-free card.",
  "start": 1947.38,
  "end": 1949.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Just survive.",
  "start": 1951.41,
  "end": 1952.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Kneecap, really hard.",
  "start": 1955.55,
  "end": 1956.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Good luck, man.",
  "start": 1997.93,
  "end": 1999.05
 },
 {
  "en": "God bless, man.",
  "start": 2027.71,
  "end": 2028.97
 },
 {
  "en": "We got a disagreement between two dogs.",
  "start": 2039.95,
  "end": 2043.36
 },
 {
  "en": "A drug addict and a thief.",
  "start": 2043.86,
  "end": 2045.72
 },
 {
  "en": "And I condone neither.",
  "start": 2046.4,
  "end": 2047.93
 },
 {
  "en": "And I wash my hands of both of them.",
  "start": 2048.48,
  "end": 2050.46
 },
 {
  "en": "But they have an issue, and we have rules.",
  "start": 2050.75,
  "end": 2053.45
 },
 {
  "en": "And without rules, we're nothing but savages.",
  "start": 2054.05,
  "end": 2056.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Therefore, with proper respect for the rules, this fight is engaged with only one rule: no weapons.",
  "start": 2057.12,
  "end": 2064.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Only man versus man, without augmentation or handicap.",
  "start": 2065.09,
  "end": 2068.98
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm done talking.",
  "start": 2071.04,
  "end": 2072.18
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not gonna fight!",
  "start": 2083.91,
  "end": 2085.06
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't think you understand the rules, friend.",
  "start": 2118.68,
  "end": 2121.34
 },
 {
  "en": "Only one man comes out alive.",
  "start": 2122.5,
  "end": 2124.16
 },
 {
  "en": "No weapons!",
  "start": 2176.14,
  "end": 2177.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Rules are rules, remember?",
  "start": 2178.2,
  "end": 2179.75
 },
 {
  "en": "If we don't have them...",
  "start": 2182.59,
  "end": 2184.29
 },
 {
  "en": "We're savages.",
  "start": 2185.35,
  "end": 2186.56
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me. You have no jacket.",
  "start": 2211.7,
  "end": 2213.9
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm just meeting someone. Give me a break.",
  "start": 2214.13,
  "end": 2216.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, this is a nice place.",
  "start": 2216.25,
  "end": 2217.87
 },
 {
  "en": "It requires jackets.",
  "start": 2218.09,
  "end": 2219.47
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't have a jacket.",
  "start": 2219.69,
  "end": 2222.55
 },
 {
  "en": "It requires jackets.",
  "start": 2219.69,
  "end": 2222.55
 },
 {
  "en": "Fine.",
  "start": 2224.65,
  "end": 2225.65
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me.",
  "start": 2234.19,
  "end": 2235.19
 },
 {
  "en": "You speak English?",
  "start": 2235.48,
  "end": 2236.82
 },
 {
  "en": "How about American?",
  "start": 2237.49,
  "end": 2238.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Can I grab a water, please?",
  "start": 2254.55,
  "end": 2256.19
 },
 {
  "en": "Please, tell me you didn't come all the way to Panama for the water.",
  "start": 2257.34,
  "end": 2260.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Family.",
  "start": 2263.6,
  "end": 2264.6
 },
 {
  "en": "That's a nice jacket... Sergio.",
  "start": 2267.42,
  "end": 2269.69
 },
 {
  "en": "It's a long story.",
  "start": 2271.11,
  "end": 2272.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "start": 2273.12,
  "end": 2274.13
 },
 {
  "en": "You're waiting for someone?",
  "start": 2276.17,
  "end": 2277.72
 },
 {
  "en": "I should have known. Good-looking ones are always taken.",
  "start": 2278.59,
  "end": 2281.84
 },
 {
  "en": "What happened to your face?",
  "start": 2286.13,
  "end": 2287.73
 },
 {
  "en": "A cat.",
  "start": 2288.67,
  "end": 2290.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Cat?",
  "start": 2288.67,
  "end": 2290.08
 },
 {
  "en": "It's a big cat.",
  "start": 2290.56,
  "end": 2291.73
 },
 {
  "en": "You push anything too far into a corner, and the claws will come out.",
  "start": 2291.93,
  "end": 2295.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Your timing's all wrong, lady.",
  "start": 2298.23,
  "end": 2301.07
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on. Hang out.",
  "start": 2298.23,
  "end": 2301.07
 },
 {
  "en": "I'd like to...",
  "start": 2301.33,
  "end": 2302.52
 },
 {
  "en": "But it ain't the right time.",
  "start": 2303.28,
  "end": 2304.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes, it is, Lincoln.",
  "start": 2308.01,
  "end": 2309.6
 },
 {
  "en": "We have a lot to discuss.",
  "start": 2313.61,
  "end": 2315.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Specifically, your brother.",
  "start": 2316.16,
  "end": 2317.79
 },
 {
  "en": "I highly suggest you talk to him.",
  "start": 2323.42,
  "end": 2325.44
 },
 {
  "en": "How are we coming with the transfer?",
  "start": 2474.96,
  "end": 2476.84
 },
 {
  "en": "There are some people that want you to break someone out of there.",
  "start": 2479.45,
  "end": 2482.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I know.",
  "start": 2483.05,
  "end": 2484.05
